7,Byangsi | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/bee/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..KXR7IA0UILUCBuGMIIS97HpvkIg-x7I6yD5gZQIqPHQ,Byangsi is an endangered indigenous language of India and Nepal. It belongs to the Sino-Tibetan language family.,Byangsi,Sino-Tibetan
